# Build output.
#
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING. A gitignore pattern with no slash in it matches
# at EVERY depth, and matches directories as readily as files — so bare
# `open-outcry` and `swarm` silently excluded cmd/open-outcry/ and cmd/swarm/,
# and this repository shipped with no main package in it at all. Anchored to the
# root, these match only the built binaries. See docs/build-log.md entry 16.
/open-outcry
/swarm
*.test

# Workshop material — written for whoever is running the event, not for a
# reader of this repository. Kept locally, never published.
docs/shot-list.md
docs/checkpoints/
docs/slides.md
shot-*.png

# Agent config
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
